{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111129","id":2879118131,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6rm9sz","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111129","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111129.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111129.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111129","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111129/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111129/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111129/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ba268416d564b23e04d145894066ce6878f62faf","number":111129,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Push pipeline compilation of various effects to the worker thread pool.","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Pipeline compilation for particles currently stalls the main thread significantly, which can get even worse if the game makes use of multiple particle shaders.\r\n\r\nPipelines aren't really required until it is time to process them when rendering, so using the worker thread pool and waiting for the pipeline to be ready then can provide a significant loading time reduction on projects that can load other things in parallel to hide the stall in a much better way.\r\n\r\nFurthermore, even in scenarios where only the particle systems are the main blocker, this should allow the engine to parallelize the workload significantly better and have much lower loading times.\r\n\r\nClearing pipeline caches (either from the driver or the one on the userdata folder when using the pipeline cache project setting) are required for measuring the benefits of this PR.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.co